# Files irrelevant to the agent optimization loop
# (infra, inactive challenges, build artifacts)
#
# WARNING: Do NOT add Dockerfile*, dashboard/, server/, or initial_algorithms/
# here. Railway CLI respects .ignore when building its upload snapshot, so
# excluding them breaks `railway up` deploys — the server Dockerfile COPYs
# each into the image (initial_algorithms/ feeds first-boot seeding).

